> Indeed I have. I guess I screwed up, though, because I wanted a good
> one-handed weapon, so wished for stormbringer and frost brand. In both
> cases, the weapon appeared in my hands then vanished. Not sure why?
> It's a pity, because I lost two wishes. :(

The number of existing artifacts effects the probability that a wish for
an artifact will succeed.  Wishes are yet another topic that has a
strategy for dealing with a limited resource.  I generally won't wish
for an artifact at all because I tend to altar dance earlier in my games
than I tend to get wishes.  Early game wishes tend to happen when
weapons are not at the top of the priority list because altar dancing
generates artifact gifts.

Look up lists of common wishes.  Thye tend to be long ones that have a
set of priorities.  Check off every item on the list you don't yet have
and your next wish is for the item at the top of the ones you don't have
yet.


